{
  "_about": "Declarative source of truth for the vendored AWS service models. botocore is pinned here; tools/sync-models.py snapshots ONLY the services listed below into models/<service>/<api_version>/ from that exact botocore release. The generator builds from the checked-in snapshot, so `cargo build` and the generator never need pip or the network. To add a service: add an entry, rerun the sync, review the diff. To bump every model: bump botocore_version + wheel_sha256, rerun the sync, review the diff. As of #428 this lists every botocore service on a protocol the generator supports (awsJson/rest-json/rest-xml/query/ec2/smithy-rpc-v2-cbor). Existing services keep their originally pinned api_version. See README.md > Model sourcing.",
  "botocore_version": "1.43.121",
